      "hasMediaInOriginal": false,
      "fallbackReason": null,
      "text": "24 July 2026 Current Affairs in Hindi & English\n\n➼ Anurag Jain को जुलाई 2026 में NITI Aayog का नया Chief Executive Officer (CEO) नियुक्त किया गया।\nAnurag Jain has been appointed as the new Chief Executive Officer (CEO) of NITI Aayog.\n\n➼ INS Malvan को Mahe-class Anti-Submarine Warfare Shallow Water Craft (ASW-SWC) के तहत भारतीय नौसेना में शामिल किया गया।\nINS Malvan has been inducted into the Indian Navy as a Mahe-class Anti-Submarine Warfare Shallow Water Craft (ASW-SWC).\n\n➼ Punjab कक्षा 1 से 12 तक Artificial Intelligence (AI) को मुख्य विषय के रूप में लागू करने वाला भारत का पहला राज्य बना।\nPunjab became the first Indian state to introduce Artificial Intelligence (AI) as a mainstream subject from Classes 1 to 12.\n\n➼ Alireza Firouzja ने Chennai Grand Masters 2026 शतरंज टूर्नामेंट का खिताब जीता।\nAlireza Firouzja won the Chennai Grand Masters 2026 chess tournament.\n\n➼ भारत का पहला Tri-Service All-Women Circumnavigation Expedition – Samudra Pradakshina स्वदेशी नौकायन पोत IASV Triveni पर सफलतापूर्वक पूरा किया गया।\nIndia’s first Tri-Service All-Women Circumnavigation Expedition – Samudra Pradakshina was successfully completed aboard the indigenous sailing vessel IASV Triveni.\n\n➼ Killai Village को तमिलनाडु का पहला Climate-Resilient Village घोषित किया गया।\nKillai Village has been recognized as Tamil Nadu’s first Climate-Resilient Village.\n\n➼ 33वां ASEAN Regional Forum (ARF) Ministerial Meeting Manila, Philippines में आयोजित किया गया।\nThe 33rd ASEAN Regional Forum (ARF) Ministerial Meeting was held in Manila, Philippines.\n\n➼ राष्ट्रपति Droupadi Murmu ने North Macedonia के Museum of the City of Skopje में Mahatma Gandhi की प्रतिमा का अनावरण किया।\nPresident Droupadi Murmu unveiled a statue of Mahatma Gandhi at the Museum of the City of Skopje in North Macedonia.\n\n➼ Botanical Survey of India (BSI) के वैज्ञानिकों ने Meghalaya में अदरक लिली की नई प्रजाति Hedychium zubin-gargianum की पहचान की।\nBotanists from the Botanical Survey of India (BSI) identified a new ginger lily species, Hedychium zubin-gargianum, in Meghalaya.\n\n➼ Mission Golden Spikes का शुभारंभ Meghalaya में किया गया।\nMission Golden Spikes was launched in Meghalaya.\n\n➼ खेल मंत्री Mansukh Mandaviya ने BWF Badminton World Championships के आधिकारिक शुभंकर Peeko का अनावरण किया।\nSports Minister Mansukh Mandaviya unveiled Peeko, the official mascot of the upcoming BWF Badminton World Championships.\n\n➼ असम में बाढ़ राहत कार्यों के लिए भारतीय सेना ने Operation Jal Rahat शुरू किया।\nThe Indian Army launched Operation Jal Rahat to assist flood rescue and relief operations in Assam.\n\n➼ Tiger Lightning 2026 सैन्य अभ्यास United States और Bangladesh के बीच आयोजित किया गया।\nThe Tiger Lightning 2026 military exercise was conducted between the United States and Bangladesh.\n\n➼ Bihar सरकार ने Operation Vidhi Palak शुरू किया।\nThe Bihar Government launched Operation Vidhi Palak.\n\n➼ Naresh Pal Gangwar को Department of Higher Education का नया सचिव नियुक्त किया गया।\nNaresh Pal Gangwar has been appointed as the new Secretary of the Department of Higher Education.",
